Scope

The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository: the tools, the
runtime, the VR integration, the build files, and the documentation.

It does NOT and cannot cover Star Wars Episode I: Racer itself. The game's code,
art, audio, and data belong to their rights holders, are not distributed here,
and you need your own legitimate copy to use any of this.

Code that this project's tools generate from the game (RecompiledFuncs/,
rsp/aspMain.cpp, and any built APKs) is a derivative of the ROM and is outside
the MIT grant for the same reason. It is made locally from your own copy and
must never be committed or shared.
